From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:16:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/23] feat(web): console-managed SMS gateway config for phone
 OTP login

Operators can now configure the phone login SMS gateway from the platform
dashboard instead of deployment variables, following the national-identity /
root-email managed-config pattern:

- sms-gateway-config.ts stores the gateway URL in a protected JSON file and
  the optional bearer token in a separate root-owned secret slot; HTTPS is
  required except a plain-HTTP loopback mock for local demos
- sms.ts prefers the enabled managed gateway and keeps env variables as a
  bootstrap fallback; adds a fixed-purpose config-test sender
- /api/platform/sms-gateway/config (GET/PATCH) and /test (POST) restrict
  writes and test sends to the mall owner
- PhoneLoginConfigPanel in PlatformDashboard with a test-send button
